<section class="pt-[180px] pb-[180px] sticky top-0 z-5 bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <h1 class="text-navy heading-1-bold">About</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Top Section -->
<section class="bg-white py-[80px] relative z-10">
  <div class="flex flex-col container gap-[50px]">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-[20px] items-center">
      <p class="body text-navy text-center max-w-2xl">
        We are among the most highly qualified sleep consultants you can find,
        and we're here to support you with expert guidance, compassion, and care
        every step of the way. You're not alone—we're in this together.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full lg:w-[95%] px-4 lg:px-0">
        <svg class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-6 h-6 z-20" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="#6fcec6" stroke="#6fcec6" stroke-width="10" />
        </svg>

        <div class="relative lg:rotate-[-2deg] w-full">
          <div
            class="relative border-[10px] lg:border-[20px] border-navy bg-cream rounded-lg shadow-lg lg:p-[40px] p-[20px]">
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-[20px]">
              <h3 class="heading-6-bold text-center">
                Hannah - Founder &amp; Qualified Sleep Consultant
              </h3>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                I'm Hannah Hiles, Mum of 2 and a Gentle and Holistic Sleep
                Consultant.
              </p>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                I had my own sleep struggles with my first son and was given
                not-so-great advice by Sleep Consultants who charged me a lot of
                money to tell me to leave my son to cry as he was overtired.
              </p>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                Everything in me told me this was wrong so I ignored the advice
                and was chronically sleep-deprived for 18 months.
              </p>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                Fast forward to my second son, I undertook an OCN Level 6 course
                which armed me with knowledge about the sleep biology of babies
                and children.
              </p>

              <div class="lg:pr-[150px] flex flex-col gap-[20px]">
                <p class="text-center body-text">
                  Now I help families everyday get more sleep by being fully
                  responsive to their babies. That means rocking, feeding to
                  sleep, co-sleeping and whatever other method you like to use.
                </p>

                <p class="sm:pr-[100px] text-center body-text">
                  I do not use any cry-it-out or controlled crying methods
                  whatsoever. They don't work long-term. I educate you on your
                  baby's individual sleep needs and give you a knowledge toolbox
                  to take with you even after we're finished working together.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div
              class="w-[180px] relative mx-auto lg:absolute lg:-bottom-10 lg:-right-10 bg-white px-[20px] pt-[20px] rounded-md shadow-xl lg:rotate-[4deg] rotate-0 border border-neutral-200 z-30">
              <svg class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 z-50" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="#6fcec6" stroke="#6fcec6" stroke-width="10" />
              </svg>

              {% image "src/assets/images/team-carley.png", "Portrait of Hannah", "w-[150px] object-cover rounded-sm"
              %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute top-[-100px] left-0 w-screen h-[100px] overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/svgs/section-cloud.svg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-cream py-[80px] relative z-10 overflow-x-hidden">
  <div class="flex flex-col container gap-[50px]">
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full lg:w-[95%] px-4 lg:px-0">
        <svg class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-6 h-6 z-20" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="#6fcec6" stroke="#6fcec6" stroke-width="10" />
        </svg>

        <div class="relative w-full lg:rotate-[2deg]">
          <div
            class="relative border-[10px] lg:border-[20px] border-navy bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-[20px] lg:p-[40px]">
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-[20px]">
              <h3 class="heading-6-bold text-center">
                Carley - Qualified Sleep Consultant
              </h3>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                Hi there! I'm Carley and I'm a holistic baby sleep consultant,
                certified OCN level 6. I'm based in the beautiful
                Garmisch-Partenkirchen, Germany. At 38 years old, I've spent the
                last 15 years working as a special education teacher, which has
                given me invaluable experience in understanding and nurturing
                little ones.
              </p>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                I'm also a proud mom to my one-year-old daughter, and happily
                married.
              </p>

              <p class="text-center body-text">
                I have a deep interest in the science behind baby and child
                brain development and sleep science, and I love incorporating
                this knowledge into my practice.
              </p>

              <p class="lg:pl-[100px] text-center body-text">
                When I'm not helping families achieve restful nights, you can
                find me cycling and mountain biking, as I'm an avid athlete.
              </p>

              <p class="lg:pl-[100px] text-center body-text">
                I'm passionate about helping families find gentle, holistic
                solutions for sleep, and I can't wait to support you and your
                little one on this journey!
              </p>
            </div>

            <div
              class="w-[180px] relative mx-auto mt-6 lg:absolute lg:-bottom-10 lg:-left-10 bg-cream px-[20px] pt-[20px] rounded-md shadow-xl rotate-0 lg:rotate-[4deg] border border-neutral-200 z-30">
              <svg class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 z-50" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="#6fcec6" stroke="#6fcec6" stroke-width="10" />
              </svg>

              {% image "src/assets/images/team-carley.png", "Portrait of Carley", "w-[150px] object-cover rounded-sm"
              %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom Section -->
<section class="bg-white py-[80px] z-10 relative mb-[656px] sm:mb-[464px]">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-[20px]">
      <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-[20px]">
        <h2 class="text-navy heading-4-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="body-text hidden lg:block">
          Still have a question? <br>Reach out to us by
          <a href="mailto:info@centre-screen.com" class="text-teal underline">email</a>
          or
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/centre.screen/" class="text-teal underline">Instagram</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col w-full flex-1">
        {%- for faq in faqs.about %}
        <div
          class="w-full flex flex-col {% if loop.first %}pb-[20px]{% else %}pt-[20px] pb-[20px]{% endif %} border-b-[3px] border-dashed border-terqoise">
          <button class="flex items-center cursor-pointer gap-[12px]" aria-expanded="false" data-accordion-trigger
            type="button">
            <span class="flex items-center w-[40px] h-[40px]">
              <img src="/assets/svgs/accordion-moon.svg" alt="Moon Icon" class="block w-[32px]" data-icon-plus>
              <img src="/assets/svgs/accordion-sun.svg" alt="Sun Icon" class="hidden w-[40px]" data-icon-minus>
            </span>
            <span class="text-navy heading-6-medium text-left">{{ faq.question }}</span>
          </button>
          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-500 ease-in-out" data-accordion-content>
            <span class="text-navy mt-[20px]">{{ faq.answer }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="body-text lg:hidden">
        Still have a question? <br>Reach out to us by
        <a href="mailto:info@centre-screen.com" class="text-teal underline">email</a>
        or
        <a class="text-teal underline" href="https://www.instagram.com/centre.screen/">Instagram</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-[-100px] left-0 w-screen h-[100px] overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/svgs/section-cloud.svg" alt=""
      class="absolute rotate-180 inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-accordion-trigger]").forEach((button) => {
    const content = button.nextElementSibling;
    const iconPlus = button.querySelector("[data-icon-plus]");
    const iconMinus = button.querySelector("[data-icon-minus]");

    button.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const isExpanded = button.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true";

      if (isExpanded) {
        content.style.maxHeight = "0";
        button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
        iconPlus.classList.remove("hidden");
        iconMinus.classList.add("hidden");
      } else {
        content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";
        button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
        iconPlus.classList.add("hidden");
        iconMinus.classList.remove("hidden");
      }
    });
  });
</script>